{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n 全国握手会\n ありがとうございましたー！\n \n \n 今日は\n 寝坊してしまい\n 服を一着しか\n 持って行けなくて\n すみませんでした\n \n \n なので\n \n 色んな\n ヘアメイクに挑戦してみました！\n \n \n 1番お気に入りの\n 3部をご紹介します✨\n \n ジャーン\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGR963E9VEE2XBXJ6EN4DD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 3部の私です（笑）\n \n さりなちゃんにもらった\n クロワッサンをつけました🥐\n \n メイクも奇抜だよ〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRA4V0ZF9KZR9DN26C6VC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRB54JP955D39SG87B68P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRC2PVTKSX2HEYXS82X3M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 近くで見るとよりすごい！(◎_◎;)\n \n ハロウィンということで\n ハロウィン仮想風にしてみたよ〜👻\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRDCF5NRR55RCQWHR97KH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 頭の上にパンを付けてたら\n 色んな人が食べてくれたよ〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGREDQV8XF7D4YZNY6DD1W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRFCFFHY38QP2PXZDXHK8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRGBKQ5TQ24F5D16WHT9M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRHACEBCK1D3NTP8QTGGV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRJEKFNGTS05BGYCTDB7X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRKCK5FH23R1SWGVGC3XF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRMD0ZW6V3JDYBHK0Q7YJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n きょんこポリスは\n 食べてくれなかったけどね👮‍♂️（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGRNBAXSWQZQJRGAYMM61Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n きょんこポリス（笑）\n \n \n \n まだまだ\n 載せきれない写真があるので\n 続きはまた更新します〜\n \n 5部の\n スナック眞緒in中国のことも！\n \n 書きたいことが\n たくさんありすぎます🇨🇳🙌\n \n ということで\n \n 今日は本当に\n ありがとうございました😊\n \n めちゃくちゃ楽しかったです✨\n \n \n p.s.\n ある方から\n スナック眞緒への\n 来店予約を承りました💓💓\n \n 今から楽しみです\n \n またご飯もご一緒したいなあ🍚"}],"source":"archive"}